/* meow-ios — Arabic (ar) localization.

   Key set is 1:1 with en.lproj — every key in en.lproj/Localizable.strings
   appears here, in the same order. Strings deliberately omitted from en.lproj
   (QA/OCR harness pins, stable diagnostic reason codes, internal chart
   bindings, log-level Picker .tag() values) must NOT be added here either —
   see en.lproj header for the exclusion list.

   Terminology follows meow-android values-ar (mobile + core): Proxy → بروكسي,
   Config → تكوين (iOS "Configs" tab), Profile → ملف التعريف, Engine → النواة,
   Upload / Download → رفع / تنزيل, Latency → زمن الاستجابة, Global → شامل.

   Style:
     - Modern Standard Arabic; buttons are short verbal nouns (إضافة / حفظ /
       إلغاء / إغلاق), accessibility hints use 3rd-person present (يفتح…).
     - In-progress states use "جارٍ …" with the single-character ellipsis
       "…" (U+2026), matching en.lproj.
     - No .stringsdict: counts use a "label: N" or unit form that reads
       correctly for any number. Western digits are kept as in en.lproj.
     - Protocol / brand identifiers (DNS, TCP, UDP, TUN, YAML, QR, Shadowsocks,
       Mihomo, Clash, no-resolve, DIRECT…) stay in Latin script.
     - No bidi control characters; SwiftUI handles RTL layout. */


